    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the Iron Flight Air Force and defend the skies against the menace of Bad Faction!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the latest graduated rookie pilot in Iron Flight Air Force you will you will be thrown straight into battle in a 2.5D, classic side scrolling shmup.\u00a0 You\u2019ll pilot a precision armed ship across <strong>two dynamic colour coded combat lanes</strong>, fending off waves of enemies, hunting high-value targets, defending friendly craft, and engaging in with mechs and bosses looking to end your path to glory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two-lane colour coded combat</strong> that keeps you switching, dodging, and destroying.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amongst the waves of enemies you will be tasked with targeting<strong> high-profile targets </strong>and <strong>defending civilian aircraft </strong>from hostile attackers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4-way aim</strong>, precision firing Orbital Attack System allows you to deliver killer shots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loadout Cache</strong>, death doesn't mean loss of weaponry, provided you were quick enough to exchange an upgrade to cache a loud-out.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet the team:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pilot</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722410/extras/29c79412cef95917befda6a6f54bcf25.avif?t=1748362086\" width=100 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Straight out of rookie school, can you step up and become a hero?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tech Kid\u00a0\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722410/extras/41f5c41204062bc7b0de55ed531d24f7.avif?t=1748362086\" width=100 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She's got your back and is basically your commanding officer when the General is busy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The General</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722410/extras/6dd2663f17ffe8fc1a6c357ea7a5a961.avif?t=1748362086\" width=100 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He hasn't got time for rookies when battle starts.\u00a0 Can you earn his respect?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the Iron Flight Air Force and defend the skies against the menace of Bad Faction!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the latest graduated rookie pilot in Iron Flight Air Force you will you will be thrown straight into battle in a 2.5D, classic side scrolling shmup.\u00a0 You\u2019ll pilot a precision armed ship across <strong>two dynamic colour coded combat lanes</strong>, fending off waves of enemies, hunting high-value targets, defending friendly craft, and engaging in with mechs and bosses looking to end your path to glory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two-lane colour coded combat</strong> that keeps you switching, dodging, and destroying.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amongst the waves of enemies you will be tasked with targeting<strong> high-profile targets </strong>and <strong>defending civilian aircraft </strong>from hostile attackers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4-way aim</strong>, precision firing Orbital Attack System allows you to deliver killer shots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loadout Cache</strong>, death doesn't mean loss of weaponry, provided you were quick enough to exchange an upgrade to cache a loud-out.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet the team:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pilot</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722410/extras/29c79412cef95917befda6a6f54bcf25.avif?t=1748362086\" width=100 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Straight out of rookie school, can you step up and become a hero?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tech Kid\u00a0\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722410/extras/41f5c41204062bc7b0de55ed531d24f7.avif?t=1748362086\" width=100 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She's got your back and is basically your commanding officer when the General is busy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The General</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722410/extras/6dd2663f17ffe8fc1a6c357ea7a5a961.avif?t=1748362086\" width=100 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He hasn't got time for rookies when battle starts.\u00a0 Can you earn his respect?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
